---
title: "lifecycle (LegionCapitalRaise)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_init: initialize(capitalRaiseInitParams)
    q_init --> q_active: Raise is active
    q_active --> q_ended: end() by LegionOrProject
    q_active --> q_canceled: cancel() by Project
    q_ended --> q_refundWindow: Refund period active
    q_refundWindow --> q_refundOver: block.timestamp >= endTime + refundDuration
    q_refundOver --> q_publishCapital: publishRaisedCapital(capitalRaised) by Legion
    q_publishCapital --> q_withdrawable: withdrawRaisedCapital() by Project
    q_withdrawable --> q_feeDistribution: Fees to Legion + Referrer, net to Project
    q_feeDistribution --> [*]: Capital distributed
    q_canceled --> q_refundAll: withdrawInvestedCapitalIfCanceled() by investors
    q_refundAll --> [*]: All capital returned

    note right of q_active
        INV-001: invest() requires signature from legionSigner
        INV-002: refund() available during refund window
    end note

    note right of q_refundOver
        INV-003: publishRaisedCapital sets final accepted amount
        INV-004: withdrawExcessInvestedCapital available for over-invested positions
    end note

    note right of q_withdrawable
        INV-005: Capital can only be withdrawn once
        INV-006: transferInvestorPosition available after refund period, before settlement
    end note
